{"id":"wb-5-362","name":"襄阳王府绿影壁","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"襄阳王府绿影壁","text":"襄阳王府绿影壁为位于中华人民共和国湖北省襄阳市襄城区的襄阳王府内的全国重点文物保护单位。该影壁作为襄阳王府的一部分修建于正统十年（1438年），至崇祯十四年（1641年）襄阳王府被焚毁，仅余此影壁。该影壁因壁身以绿矾镶嵌而成，故通体呈墨绿色。其通长25.12米，厚1.6米，最高处6.6米，为中国现存最大的石雕龙壁。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%84%E9%98%B3%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%9C%E7%BB%BF%E5%BD%B1%E5%A3%81","revisionId":92857958,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92857958","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f1d9b5bd6b91a70a53740e39.jpg","title":"Xiangyang_Wangfu_Yingbi_2013.08.23_13-20-43.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xiangyang_Wangfu_Yingbi_2013.08.23_13-20-43.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/Xiangyang_Wangfu_Yingbi_2013.08.23_13-20-43.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"襄阳王府绿影壁","width":320,"height":213}}